@startuml
title PayLink - Refund a Failed Payment
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor Customer
participant "Client App" as CL
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Payment\nProcessing" as PAY
participant "Accounts and\nWallet" as WAL
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Event Dispatcher\n+ Outbox" as EVT
participant "Biller\nIntegration" as BI
participant "External\nBiller" as EXT
participant "Notifications" as NOT
participant "SMS / Push\nProvider" as SMS

note over PAY, DB
  Starting point: payment is SentToBiller.
  amount + fee are already in the held balance
  (hold created during "Pay a Bill"). No new debit.
end note

== 1. Biller refuses ==
PAY -> BI : send(payment, unique reference)
BI -> EXT : payment request (10 s timeout)
EXT --> BI : refused (biller error code, e.g. amount above bill)
BI -> BI : map biller error code to common reason
BI --> PAY : refused + common reason
PAY -> DB : state SentToBiller -> Failed

== 2. Release the hold ==
group single DB transaction
  PAY -> WAL : release hold(payment)
  WAL -> DB : lock wallet row (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE)
  WAL -> DB : ledger entry HOLD_RELEASE\n(held balance down, available balance up)
  WAL --> PAY : hold released
  PAY -> DB : state Failed -> Refunded
  PAY -> DB : write audit record (who, when, why)
  PAY -> DB : write outbox event PaymentFailed(reason)
end

== 3. Notify customer ==
EVT -> NOT : PaymentFailed (from outbox)
NOT -> SMS : send SMS + push with clear reason
alt delivered
  SMS --> NOT : ok
else provider fails
  loop up to 3 times
    NOT -> SMS : retry
  end
  NOT -> DB : mark message undelivered
  note right of NOT
    Payment result is not affected.
    Support can still see the status.
  end note
end

== 4. Status ==
Customer -> CL : check payment status
CL -> API : GET /payments/{reference}
API -> PAY : getStatus(reference)
PAY --> API : Refunded + reason + amount returned
API --> CL : status
CL --> Customer : payment failed, amount returned to wallet

== Timeout case (not a refund) ==
note over PAY, EXT
  If the biller does NOT answer within 10 s:
  state SentToBiller -> Unknown, hold stays,
  NO refund. Re-queried at 1, 5, 15 minutes,
  then waits for reconciliation.
  Refund happens only after the payment becomes Failed.
end note
@enduml